# --- Installer-owned, deliberately untracked ---
# Most of ~/.claude and ~/.codex is installed or written at runtime by other
# tools. Tracking it would make chezmoi and those installers fight: apply would
# revert their updates, and their updates would read as permanent chezmoi drift.
# Only the hand-written files are in the source tree.
#
# GSD installer (see ~/.claude/gsd-file-manifest.json) owns these:
.claude/agents/gsd-*
.claude/agents/gem-*
.claude/hooks/gsd-*
.claude/hooks/lib
.claude/hooks/package.json
.claude/hooks/managed-hooks-registry.cjs
.claude/hooks/context-mode-cache-heal.mjs
# Runtime state, caches, and history:
.claude/projects
.claude/plugins
.claude/cache
.claude/archives
.claude/backup
.claude/backups
.claude/debug
.claude/jobs
.claude/ide
.claude/paste-cache
.claude/file-history
.claude/daemon*
.claude/history.jsonl
.claude/*-cache.json
.claude/gsd-*
# 5.3 MB binary; recorded in packages/binary-installs.txt instead:
.claude/bin
# Credentials and runtime state:
# GSD also generates the codex agent TOMLs and its update hook
# (gsd-core/bin/lib/codex-agent-toml.cjs in its manifest):
.codex/agents/gem-*
.codex/hooks/gsd-*
.codex/auth.json
.codex/history.jsonl
.codex/cache
.codex/*.sqlite
.config/gh/hosts.yml

